  documentId: guard-jacket
  title: The abandoned jacket
  body: 'A black leather jacket. The cuffs are creased and worn smooth.


    There
    is an old bus ticket in one pocket and a dry pen in the other. Whoever wore it
    seems to have expected to come back.'
